  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_participants: Geralt; Oreck; Kyh; coherent Luminaire; active Applicator; Elara; Kethran; Solantri council; Solantri guard"
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Receive the local diagnosis that Lentharis is waking in fear, Proto-Dracos are converging, and something inside Geralt is answering the signal."
  - line: 21
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_boundary_evidence: Entry into the City of Echoes resets the arrival sequence into a separately staged council audience; Elara's order to descend into the Underchamber begins the next investigative situation."
  - line: 22
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity: Applicator resumes overt activity without explaining its complete silence in Chapter 052."
  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "Kethran distinguishes the Anchor bond, the Architect's resonance, and another frequency using the Applicator."
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "Architect's echo is resonance language and does not downgrade coherent, reconstituted Luminaire to Echo status."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_presentation: Local audience, diagnosis, and emergency escalation"
  - line: 26
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_cutscene_purpose: Connect Geralt's internal machinery to Umbrageous's crisis before the exact mechanism is established."
  - line: 27
